# Public site origin (no trailing slash): metadataBase, canonical URLs, the sitemap, robots.txt,
# the JSON-LD and the site line on the generated resume PDF all derive from it (lib/site.ts).
# Set it in Vercel for every environment. When unset, a Vercel build falls back to the project's
# production hostname and a local build to http://localhost:3000 (the resume then prints no site).
NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
